{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bubble Rage \u2013 Where Your Patience Pops Before the Bubbles Do</h2><br>It all started at <strong>Global Game Jam 2025 in Abu Dhabi</strong>, when four friends decided to ruin lives with a game about bubbles.  <br>We won <strong>1st place</strong>, got way too much positive feedback, and thought:  <br><strong>What if we made it even worse?</strong><br><br>In this unforgiving world of traps, fake platforms, and brutal challenges, you play as a poor little mouse caught in a twisted experiment.  <br>A smug cat is testing your limits \u2014 not your skill, but your ability to stay calm while everything is trying to break you.<br><br>There are no checkpoints.  <br>No mercy.  <br>Just you, gravity, and your rage.<br><br>And just when you think you've got the timing down\u2026 <strong>a random bubble appears and bumps you off.</strong>  <br>These mischievous little jerks float in without warning, knock you mid-jump, and send you spiraling into the void.  <br>They're cute. They're round. They're evil.<br><br>Every level is a test of reflexes, memory, and raw determination. Disappearing platforms, sarcastic taunts, unpredictable bubbles, and cruel surprises wait around every corner.  <br>But if you can laugh through the pain (or cry through the laughter), you just might make it to the top.<br><br><strong>Bubble Rage is built for those who love to suffer \u2014 and for streamers who love to share it.</strong>  <br>Because watching your friends fall from glory to rock bottom never gets old.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fall All the Way Back</strong><br>One mistake, and you\u2019re plummeting. How far? You\u2019ll find out.<br></li><li><strong>Random Bubbles, Real Rage</strong><br>Floating bubbles show up uninvited and push you off like it\u2019s their job. (It kind of is.)<br></li><li><strong>Troll-Level Design</strong><br>Nothing is safe. Everything is suspicious. Trust no platform.<br></li><li><strong>Built to Mock You</strong><br>From sarcastic signs to smug enemy design, the game <strong>knows</strong> what it\u2019s doing.<br></li><li><strong>Perfect for Streaming</strong><br>Easy to pick up, impossible to play calmly. Viewers will love your suffering. So will we.</li></ul><br><strong>You climb. You fall. You rage. The cat just watches.</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I like bubbles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/f800952b51307109f4b271e4571e79eb856f0b93.jpg"},{"name":"I hate bubbles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/485f11b6c4756cb2bec133c4a627be964f199846.jpg"},{"name":"I love bubbles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/07d8b574a1a2989749e087d6c3faae3a85712e3f.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Beater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/61d73188a29e5b382af123f555fa9f331f4b8c48.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/5b0d987ac6a18b99863a946595d89fccc16db81b.jpg"},{"name":"Bubble Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/3a962b520e7ab7b3d7ab27d32b8f0afd7388c28c.jpg"},{"name":"Am I fast?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/39a2999e450d0a34ba8cb6897e1bb10457ba2fda.jpg"},{"name":"I am fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/8ebc09b8228c0b35661f0848dc7bf93e5753dd01.jpg"},{"name":"I am super fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/d02ab7b0480bae9d977fb2708e0343a89fdce189.jpg"},{"name":"That's not funny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689630/4ca1a9a42f16f4180ac7158475c2d9f51dd4b079.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.ak